<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP says supports Foster's.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP says supports Foster's.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's largest company, The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP), expressed support on Friday for the Foster's Brewing Group amid speculation the resources giant may sell its 37 percent stake in the brewer.</p>
<p>&quot;We are seeking to support Foster's in building value in the stock and we believe that it's now in the growth phase or expansion mode having completed a major period of restructuring,&quot; BHP managing director John Prescott said.</p>
<p>Prescott, speaking to reporters about BHP's interim profit results, did not elaborate on his remark.</p>
